# Bytes that are hashed, locked or executed must be identical on every host, Windows included: the legal documents and manifest are
# compared by sha256 (the release legal contract), Cargo.lock and pnpm-lock.yaml are held by --locked and --frozen-lockfile, and the
# committed pre-push hook runs under sh. Git converts nothing to CRLF here, whatever core.autocrlf says.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
